# Learn › lesson 1 ("Hands in the Dark") from the title: the lesson card asks
# for the idle worker on Layer 1 (selected by a click on its label, assigned
# by Enter), then 10 credits; the lesson completes into the results.
until 300 Daily Vein
frames 30
click =Play
until 60 Choose your shift
frames 10
click Interactive lessons
until 60 Hands in the Dark
frames 10
save learn-list
click Hands in the Dark
until 60 Start shift
expect Lesson: Hands in the Dark
frames 5
click =Start shift
until 60 Lesson 1/2
frames 30
save lesson-step-1
click =L1
frames 10
expect Layer 1
# Up from the top layer keeps L1 and hands the keys back from the label to the mine.
key ArrowUp 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
until 60 Lesson 2/2
frames 10
save lesson-step-2
until 1200 Lesson complete!
until 120 Shift ended
frames 30
save lesson-results
expect final score
key Tab 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
until 120 Daily Vein
click =Play
until 60 Choose your shift
frames 5
click Interactive lessons
until 60 Deeper Pockets
expect ✓ Hands in the Dark
